WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.410
Give thanks!

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.420
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.830
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:25.000
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:48.090 --> 00:01:50.920
Someone once said:

00:01:51.320 --> 00:01:56.290
There are schools of medaka 
that live on river bottoms

00:01:56.290 --> 00:02:01.300
and taste as salty and 
delicious as edamame...

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:04.800
Edamamedaka!

00:02:09.710 --> 00:02:16.550
There are seals that taste like lightly 
sweet, slightly bitter eclairs...

00:02:16.550 --> 00:02:20.520
Seaclairs!

00:02:21.090 --> 00:02:24.290
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:24.290 --> 00:02:30.090
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:32.830 --> 00:02:36.670
After evolving to the point of being 
able to deliver a 15-fold Spiked Punch,

00:02:36.670 --> 00:02:39.700
Toriko revealed to Sunny his plans 
for challenging the Gourmet World

00:02:39.700 --> 00:02:41.810
and was told the best way to get there.

00:02:43.110 --> 00:02:46.980
Komatsu, who had no idea Toriko had 
already left for the Gourmet World,

00:02:46.980 --> 00:02:49.310
suddenly got a visitor.

00:02:50.110 --> 00:02:53.320
Toriko entered the Gourmet World alone.

00:02:53.320 --> 00:02:57.360
There, he received one violent 
baptism after another!

00:03:00.490 --> 00:03:05.900
Enter the Astounding Ringer! 
The True Meaning of a Partner!

00:03:45.500 --> 00:03:49.270
Asura Tiger (Mammalian Beast) 
Capture Level Unmeasurable

00:03:50.840 --> 00:03:54.010
B-Body's... heavy...

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:17.670
What the hell is this?!

00:04:17.670 --> 00:04:20.970
It's like my weight's increased 
several times over!

00:04:24.640 --> 00:04:26.810
Leg Knife!

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:46.630
N-Now what?! I can barely see...

00:04:46.930 --> 00:04:49.630
And my limbs have gone numb!

00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:55.270
King Luxray (Mammalian Beast) 
Capture Level Unmeasurable

00:04:58.440 --> 00:05:03.480
F-Fifteen-fold Spiked Punch!

00:06:06.810 --> 00:06:08.610
What's this?!

00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:26.860
My weight's back to normal...

00:06:27.330 --> 00:06:29.130
My arms and legs, too...

00:06:29.330 --> 00:06:31.400
And I can see again.

00:06:31.400 --> 00:06:37.240
But it's hot. Unnaturally hot...

00:06:37.640 --> 00:06:38.980
Hot!

00:06:45.980 --> 00:06:47.150
This isn't good...

00:06:47.150 --> 00:06:48.790
Such incredible heat...

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:52.020
My body will dry up!

00:06:52.520 --> 00:06:55.590
I-I'll get water from the cactus...

00:06:59.260 --> 00:07:02.530
This is a cactus, isn't it?

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:06.470
Knife...

00:07:08.910 --> 00:07:10.340
W-What the...?!

00:07:21.850 --> 00:07:24.420
Again?! My body's heavy again!

00:07:27.690 --> 00:07:29.130
This place is...

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:31.700
Now it's fog, eh?

00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:35.170
What's the deal with this world?!

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:39.400
The fog's so thick, I 
can't see a damn thing!

00:07:45.140 --> 00:07:46.880
What the hell...?!

00:07:46.880 --> 00:07:49.350
It's raining all of a sudden!

00:07:49.710 --> 00:07:51.420
What a squall!

00:07:51.420 --> 00:07:54.320
No, it's more a waterfall than rain!

00:07:54.320 --> 00:07:57.190
They're like water missiles!

00:08:00.060 --> 00:08:03.530
It feels like they're 
gonna pulverize me!

00:08:03.530 --> 00:08:05.860
Gotta... Gotta...

00:08:05.860 --> 00:08:08.530
...get away from here fast before...

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:47.370
Mamew (Avian Beast) Capture 
Level Unmeasurable

00:09:02.790 --> 00:09:06.520
All that rain and it didn't 
hurt them in the least...

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:17.270
So this is the Gourmet World...

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:23.040
As I expected, I'm 
getting a tough baptism!

00:09:39.660 --> 00:09:43.230
I give up drinking when 
I'm in the Gourmet World.

00:09:45.960 --> 00:09:49.730
Preparation is everything here...

00:09:50.840 --> 00:09:52.070
...Toriko-kun!

00:10:04.850 --> 00:10:05.980
You!

00:10:16.490 --> 00:10:18.800
These critters are called Mamews.

00:10:19.630 --> 00:10:25.040
They always travel in packs 
and if danger approaches...

00:10:25.500 --> 00:10:28.340
They call forth an extraordinary 
amount of back-up.

00:10:50.800 --> 00:10:54.230
Knocking Rifle, hard type...

00:11:44.920 --> 00:11:49.690
Amazing... A Knocking Rifle 
that shoots needles...

00:11:49.690 --> 00:11:54.030
That hard type is notoriously difficult 
to use, but he wields it effortlessly.

00:11:54.460 --> 00:11:56.930
He nailed every single one of them...

00:12:03.270 --> 00:12:05.040
The creatures from before!

00:12:08.970 --> 00:12:11.140
Cut it out.

00:12:34.230 --> 00:12:37.570
Do me a favor and take 
your fight elsewhere?

00:12:37.570 --> 00:12:39.600
Monkey and cat...

00:12:42.440 --> 00:12:45.240
You're annoying me!

00:12:59.560 --> 00:13:03.430
I guess you'd call that... 
Intimidation Knocking,

00:13:03.430 --> 00:13:04.760
Toriko-kun?

00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:08.070
You even got me quivering...

00:13:09.030 --> 00:13:12.100
To think, I got saved by a 
legendary Gourmet Hunter...

00:13:12.100 --> 00:13:15.910
I don't know how to thank 
you, Knocking Master Jiro.

00:13:17.640 --> 00:13:19.540
No need to thank me.

00:13:19.780 --> 00:13:26.150
I owed you for that time you 
gave me some booze on the train.

00:13:30.360 --> 00:13:32.890
To me, sake is life.

00:13:32.890 --> 00:13:35.890
And I never forget a sake debt.

00:13:35.890 --> 00:13:38.500
Is booze all you think about?!

00:13:38.500 --> 00:13:41.230
And how'd you get to be this young?!

00:13:41.230 --> 00:13:42.770
Never mind that, Toriko-kun.

00:13:43.400 --> 00:13:45.770
It seems this is your first 
time in the Gourmet World.

00:13:45.770 --> 00:13:47.710
H-How'd you know that?!

00:13:48.010 --> 00:13:50.410
You're not alert enough.

00:13:51.280 --> 00:13:53.650
For someone who entered 
the Gourmet World,

00:13:53.650 --> 00:13:56.450
you're too vulnerable, both 
mentally and physically.

00:13:56.450 --> 00:13:57.620
I am not...

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:06.390
Did I catch you off guard?

00:14:06.390 --> 00:14:08.090
You would've been dead.

00:14:08.260 --> 00:14:09.290
What are you...?!

00:14:09.830 --> 00:14:15.830
In the Gourmet World, your 
concentration must always be at its peak.

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:20.610
It's forbidden to let your 
guard down, even for a moment.

00:14:20.610 --> 00:14:25.310
Observing the surroundings while 
maintaining vigilance is one of the basics!

00:14:26.040 --> 00:14:32.080
I knew you were a Gourmet World 
beginner the instant you let your guard slip.

00:14:32.080 --> 00:14:34.290
I have been on guard...

00:14:34.290 --> 00:14:38.120
It's just, my body's so 
heavy... since I got here...

00:14:38.120 --> 00:14:43.430
Naturally. This place is 20,000 
meters below sea level.

00:14:43.430 --> 00:14:47.100
And it's name is... Underground Forest.

00:14:47.330 --> 00:14:52.000
Gravity is stronger the closer 
you are to the planet's core.

00:14:52.000 --> 00:14:56.240
I bet our weights are several times 
what they are on the surface.

00:14:56.240 --> 00:15:01.010
Then I fell 20,000 meters 
from the Life Basin?

00:15:01.010 --> 00:15:03.920
No wonder my body's so heavy...

00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:05.750
There's no need to worry.

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:10.090
Knowing you, Toriko-kun, I'm sure 
you'll adapt soon to even this gravity.

00:15:10.620 --> 00:15:14.790
There was a place where my eyes became 
bloodshot and my limbs got all numb...

00:15:14.790 --> 00:15:16.190
What was that?

00:15:16.190 --> 00:15:18.630
You must've gotten 
close to the Air Tree.

00:15:18.630 --> 00:15:20.260
Air Tree?

00:15:20.260 --> 00:15:24.840
Yeah. It's an unusual tree that 
puts out air through its fruit.

00:15:25.470 --> 00:15:28.640
However, the oxygen and carbon 
dioxide that make up the air

00:15:28.640 --> 00:15:35.650
are produced separately, so 
sometimes the volume ratio is off.

00:15:36.380 --> 00:15:42.520
That makes your eyes bad, and 
your limbs probably went numb

00:15:42.520 --> 00:15:46.090
from overproduction of oxygen.

00:15:46.990 --> 00:15:52.460
See, if the concentration of oxygen 
increases, it destroys tissue in the body.

00:15:52.460 --> 00:15:55.670
Guess I'm lucky it was oxygen...

00:15:55.670 --> 00:15:58.140
If it had been carbon 
dioxide or carbon monoxide,

00:15:58.140 --> 00:16:00.070
I could've been killed instantly.

00:16:00.670 --> 00:16:04.940
Incidentally, the fruit of the 
Air Tree is also an ingredient.

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:07.810
A super-special preparation 
ingredient...

00:16:07.810 --> 00:16:10.350
Ingredient? It's edible?!

00:16:12.050 --> 00:16:13.450
Not only that...

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:17.720
There's an extraordinary ingredient 
called Heat Planet in this forest.

00:16:18.060 --> 00:16:20.090
It possesses a strong gravitational pull

00:16:20.090 --> 00:16:23.160
that perfectly matches the 
gravity of the planet.

00:16:23.460 --> 00:16:26.360
Because of that, if 
you're near Heat Planet,

00:16:26.360 --> 00:16:30.000
your body won't be heavy, 
so it's easy to move.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:33.710
But the closer you get to it, the 
hotter the waves of heat it gives off.

00:16:33.710 --> 00:16:38.540
So that's what made me so hot it 
felt like my body was gonna dry up!

00:16:38.540 --> 00:16:45.120
Toriko-kun, that waterfall you fell 
from streamed down from Fall Tree.

00:16:45.380 --> 00:16:49.220
When a creature goes under the tree, 
the leaves fire water missiles all at once

00:16:49.220 --> 00:16:53.190
to kill it, and then the tree's 
roots absorb the prey.

00:16:54.130 --> 00:16:58.700
This is... the Gourmet World?!

00:16:59.560 --> 00:17:03.330
Toriko-kun, the way you are now...

00:17:06.940 --> 00:17:09.840
...you can't conquer the Gourmet World.

00:17:10.480 --> 00:17:13.650
I was the same way when I was young.

00:17:13.650 --> 00:17:15.550
I tried to do everything by myself.

00:17:15.550 --> 00:17:18.180
I thought I could do it alone.

00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:23.120
But the Gourmet World isn't that simple.

00:17:28.860 --> 00:17:34.630
Toriko-kun, it isn't power 
that you lack right now.

00:17:35.070 --> 00:17:36.200
It's faith...

00:17:36.770 --> 00:17:38.440
Trust...

00:17:38.440 --> 00:17:42.310
You don't believe in your comrade... 
your partner... Komatsu-kun.

00:17:42.670 --> 00:17:44.110
Komatsu...

00:17:44.110 --> 00:17:46.040
Toriko-san!

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:50.980
Please wait for me, Toriko-san!

00:17:50.980 --> 00:17:55.950
Partnering with Toriko-san... 
This makes me so happy!

00:17:57.390 --> 00:17:58.620
Komatsu...

00:17:59.220 --> 00:18:04.300
The person who asked me to 
help you here, Toriko-kun...

00:18:04.300 --> 00:18:06.430
...is none other than Komatsu-kun.

00:18:09.430 --> 00:18:13.440
What's wrong, Sunny-san? I wasn't 
expecting a visit from you.

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:16.040
Congratulations on partnering 
up with Toriko...

00:18:16.040 --> 00:18:18.840
How can I put it...? 
It's not a bad idea.

00:18:18.840 --> 00:18:20.910
Thank you!

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:23.150
So, about Toriko...

00:18:23.150 --> 00:18:25.550
Right now, he's heading 
for the Gourmet World.

00:18:25.550 --> 00:18:26.920
Really?!

00:18:26.920 --> 00:18:31.290
The way Toriko is now, his 
life is in danger... perhaps.

00:18:31.560 --> 00:18:34.430
Although it has nothing to do with me...

00:18:34.430 --> 00:18:36.690
What should I... What should I do?!

00:18:36.690 --> 00:18:41.470
To be honest, I would absolutely never 
do anything this lacking in beauty...

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:46.270
But Matsu, if it's really your will 
to save your partner, Toriko...

00:18:47.270 --> 00:18:49.510
...you should ask someone to help.

00:18:51.610 --> 00:18:54.480
Call this number. Immediately!

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:12.060
Toriko-san...

00:19:13.400 --> 00:19:16.970
He said, "If anything should 
happen to Toriko-san..."

00:19:16.970 --> 00:19:20.670
and requested my help 
with tears in his eyes.

00:19:20.670 --> 00:19:24.310
While you said nothing and 
just went off on your own,

00:19:24.310 --> 00:19:31.150
Komatsu-kun has been worried about 
you, praying for your safety.

00:19:44.360 --> 00:19:47.170
You should return to the Human World.

00:19:47.170 --> 00:19:52.140
And then, one day... challenge 
this world together!

00:19:53.370 --> 00:19:54.770
Komatsu!

00:20:12.960 --> 00:20:14.660
I'm starving!

00:20:14.660 --> 00:20:16.090
Komatsu!

00:20:19.330 --> 00:20:20.530
Toriko-san...

00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:21.770
Toriko-san!

00:20:22.100 --> 00:20:23.500
Toriko-san!

00:20:23.500 --> 00:20:29.940
Toriko-san!!

00:20:35.510 --> 00:20:37.080
Sabrina

00:20:38.150 --> 00:20:40.320
Pa-pa-pa-para

00:20:40.650 --> 00:20:42.150
saburina / Sabrina

00:20:44.120 --> 00:20:51.260
Rainy day, danced down on the night city

00:20:51.260 --> 00:20:58.100
You had deep red lipstick on you

00:20:58.100 --> 00:21:01.870
Like you were toyed with

00:21:01.870 --> 00:21:05.340
Like you were tasted

00:21:05.340 --> 00:21:12.450
A solitary silhouette seen through the glass

00:21:12.450 --> 00:21:19.220
One day, one day... Search for true love

00:21:19.220 --> 00:21:26.260
Even if hurt by the lies going around town

00:21:26.260 --> 00:21:31.000
Rottening fruit

00:21:31.000 --> 00:21:32.570
Sabrina

00:21:36.540 --> 00:21:38.540
Gourmet News!

00:21:40.010 --> 00:21:41.880
I'm your host, Tina!

00:21:41.880 --> 00:21:44.880
There's nothing selfish about 
frying up shellfish!

00:21:44.880 --> 00:21:47.220
Just fry 'em up and 
they'll be delicious.

00:21:47.220 --> 00:21:49.820
But that's too simple!

00:21:49.820 --> 00:21:53.860
If only <i>he</i> were here 
at a time like this...!

00:21:57.460 --> 00:21:59.130
Buon giorno!

00:21:59.730 --> 00:22:03.900
Today, I'll introduce you to a 
delicious dish that uses shellfish.

00:22:05.200 --> 00:22:09.140
Put a tablespoon of olive oil, 
a teaspoon of lemon juice,

00:22:09.140 --> 00:22:12.940
two tablespoons of water, and nori 
boiled down in soy sauce in a pan,

00:22:12.940 --> 00:22:14.580
then mix it.

00:22:15.310 --> 00:22:17.980
Saute scallops in olive oil.

00:22:18.950 --> 00:22:22.150
Add the sauce we made 
before and to top it off,

00:22:22.150 --> 00:22:25.490
lightly sprinkle it with chopped nori.

00:22:25.490 --> 00:22:29.390
Taccino Fantasy!

00:22:29.160 --> 00:22:32.330
Sauteed Scallops Nori Sauce

00:22:29.860 --> 00:22:32.760
Sauteed Scallops! Nori Sauce!

00:22:33.360 --> 00:22:35.530
Thank you for the food!

00:22:38.440 --> 00:22:40.670
A heaping helping of buono!

00:22:45.340 --> 00:22:47.210
It's been fun, Tina.

00:22:48.250 --> 00:22:51.580
And to all of you, too, let's meet 
again, sometime, somewhere...

00:22:51.580 --> 00:22:52.880
Ciao!

00:22:56.150 --> 00:22:58.860
Grazie, Taccino!

00:22:59.220 --> 00:23:01.930
Thank you, Taccino-san!

00:23:02.690 --> 00:23:04.560
Now on to the next story!

00:23:07.010 --> 00:23:08.300
Here's a big scoop!

00:23:08.300 --> 00:23:11.430
Next time, Toriko and One Piece cross over again!

00:23:11.430 --> 00:23:13.380
The ultimate team is reunited!

00:23:13.380 --> 00:23:16.890
The Reunion of Toriko and Luffy! Find the Seafood Fruit!

00:23:17.130 --> 00:23:19.090
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
